WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:11.466
Hi! Is it The dog barks or The dog bark? Today we'll learn subject–verb agreement: the subject and the verb must match.

2
00:00:11.616 --> 00:00:16.674
With one subject, the verb takes s. With many, it doesn't.

3
00:00:16.824 --> 00:00:22.578
One uses is, many uses are: The cat is black. The cats are black.

4
00:00:22.728 --> 00:00:28.146
One uses has, many uses have: She has a pen. They have pens.

5
00:00:28.296 --> 00:00:34.170
In the past it's the same: one uses was, many uses were.

6
00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:38.082
Two people joined by and are plural, so use are.

7
00:00:38.232 --> 00:00:43.050
Everyone, everybody and each are singular, so use is and has.

8
00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:49.842
In the box of pens, the subject is box, which is one, so use is. Ignore pens.

9
00:00:49.992 --> 00:00:56.274
In questions, first ask: who is doing it? One, or many?

10
00:00:56.424 --> 00:01:00.858
Watch out! Using are because you see apples is wrong!

11
00:01:01.008 --> 00:01:07.074
It's the basket that's heavy. The subject is basket, which is one, so use is.

12
00:01:07.224 --> 00:01:11.562
When you see of, look at the noun before it.

13
00:01:11.712 --> 00:01:20.970
Your turn! The birds, ___, in the tree. Is or are? Pause and think.

14
00:01:21.120 --> 00:01:26.370
Birds is plural, so are. Did you get it right?

15
00:01:26.520 --> 00:01:36.234
Another one! My father, ___, a red car. Have or has? Pause and think.

16
00:01:36.384 --> 00:01:42.282
My father is one person, so has. Did you get it right?

17
00:01:42.432 --> 00:01:52.434
Here's another! Tom and Ravi, ___, good friends. Is or are? Pause and think.

18
00:01:52.584 --> 00:01:58.170
Two people joined by and, so are. Did you get it right?

19
00:01:58.320 --> 00:02:07.914
Try one more! Everyone, ___, happy today. Is or are? Pause and think.

20
00:02:08.064 --> 00:02:13.554
Everyone is singular, so is. Did you get it right?

21
00:02:13.704 --> 00:02:23.970
Try one more! The box of crayons, ___, on the desk. Was or were? Pause and think.

22
00:02:24.120 --> 00:02:30.498
The subject is box, which is one, so was. Did you get it right?

23
00:02:30.648 --> 00:02:40.002
Last one! My shoes, ___, dirty. Is or are? Pause and think.

24
00:02:40.152 --> 00:02:45.402
Shoes is plural, so are. Did you get it right?

25
00:02:45.552 --> 00:02:59.610
Remember: find the subject first. One takes is, has, was and a verb with s. Many takes are, have, were. Two things joined by and are plural, everyone is singular, and with of, look at the noun before it.

26
00:02:59.760 --> 00:03:07.170
Today, say two sentences: one about one person, one about many people!

